    {
      "source": "This factory implements <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>InitializingBean</code></a> and <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/DisposableBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>DisposableBean</code></a>\nand is expected typically to be declared as a Spring-managed bean.",
      "translation": "该工厂实现了<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>InitializingBean</code></a>和<a href=\"../../../beans/factory/DisposableBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>DisposableBean</code></a>，通常预期声明为 Spring 管理的 Bean。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This method allows the bean instance to perform validation of its overall\nconfiguration and final initialization when all bean properties have been set.",
      "translation": "此方法允许 Bean 实例在其所有属性设置完成后，执行其整体配置验证和最终初始化。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked by the containing <code>BeanFactory</code> after it has set all bean properties\nand satisfied <a href=\"../../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactoryAware</code></a>, <code>ApplicationContextAware</code> etc.",
